# Contact

Want to talk with Allen? Send an email and include these lines. That is enough to start — no form, no account needed.

**Email: [spritenee@gmail.com](mailto:spritenee@gmail.com)**

Please include:

1. **What you want** — understand China, learn Chinese, learn Tai Chi, visit China with a local guide, or a mix?
2. **Your level** — complete beginner is fine, and is the most common answer. For Chinese: can you say a few sentences yet? For Tai Chi: never tried it, tried a little, or already practising?
3. **Why you are here** — travel, work, family, heritage, health, interest in Chinese culture, or something else?
4. **If you are visiting China** — where, when, how many days, and who is coming with you?
5. **How you found this site** — search, YouTube, a friend, or somewhere else?

You can also find Allen here:

- YouTube: https://youtube.com/spritenee
- Facebook: https://facebook.com/spritenee
- X: https://twitter.com/spritenee

> Everything on this site — culture pieces, lessons, Tai Chi guides, and news explanations — is free for now. Course collections and one-to-one online lessons are not offered yet; they will come later, once the sections have built up. A local guide is a personal arrangement, not a listed course. For now, this email is for following along, asking a question, or telling Allen what you would like to learn. Nothing on this page promises a specific course, schedule, or result.
